        "TileImage": "$($repository ee2af034-8ebe-43f8-a8f3-525e060dbb31).Image",
        "Description": "Goodmorning 47,\r\rYour targets are Baltazar Morrison,Jorge Padilla,William Pettus and Ruperto Devine. These 4 men are planning a terrorist attack at the Miami Global Innovation race. Morrison has been arrested and the bomb he had with him has been locked up in a safe. The client asks you to eliminate these four men and retrieve the bomb. Padilla, Pettus and Devine have to be taken out with a sniper rifle to minimize risk. We recommend the kronstadt center roof as a vantage point.\r\rgood luck 47",
